1
00:00:00,390 --> 00:00:02,430
Yeah, I-I miss you, too.

2
00:00:03,430 --> 00:00:05,430
(Leonard:)Okay, sure, I'll call you
when I get home.

3
00:00:05,430 --> 00:00:06,930
(Leonard:)Okay, bye-bye.

4
00:00:06,930 --> 00:00:08,200
(Raj:)Very nice.

5
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,000
(Raj:)You lie to my sister.

6
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:13,610
(Howard:)That's the nicest thing
he does to your sister.

7
00:00:18,010 --> 00:00:20,950
(cell phone ringing)

8
00:00:20,950 --> 00:00:22,450
(Raj(phone rings):)Oh, guess who.

9
00:00:22,450 --> 00:00:23,980
(Leonard:)Cover for me.

10
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:27,320
(Raj:)Hello, Priya. What's up?

11
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:29,690
(Raj:)How would I know
if Leonard's at work or not?

12
00:00:29,690 --> 00:00:32,220
(Raj:)Don't be suspicious.

13
00:00:32,230 --> 00:00:33,990
(Raj:)Look, if you want your
relationship with Leonard

14
00:00:33,990 --> 00:00:35,660
(Raj:)to continue,
you're going to have to believe

15
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:37,430
(Raj:)whatever wild-eyed,
cockamamie excuse

16
00:00:37,430 --> 00:00:39,660
(Raj:)the white devil
has the nerve to offer you.

17
00:00:41,470 --> 00:00:44,400
(Raj:)Okay? Yeah, bye-bye.

18
00:00:45,370 --> 00:00:47,240
(Raj:)You owe me.

19
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:49,980
New puzzle, Ma!

20
00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:51,280
"Same name"!

21
00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:52,980
One N, two D's, three O's!

22
00:00:52,980 --> 00:00:55,680
MRS. WOLOWITZ:
Whoopi and Rube Goldberg!

23
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:57,020
(Sheldon:)That's uncanny.

24
00:00:57,020 --> 00:00:58,850
(Penny:)I know.
It's her superpower.

